{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-707207a7af7f8cf16370","statement":"[<<cite:A12-2>>] Let $k$ be admissible. Then an irreducible highest weight representation $L(\\lam)$ is a $V_k(\\fing)$-module if and only if $k\\in Pr_k$. Hence if $M$ is a finitely generated $V_k(\\fing)$-module on which $\\affn_+$ acts locally nilpotently and $\\affh$ acts locally finitely then $M$ is a direct sum of $L(\\lam)$ with $\\lam\\in Pr_k$.","source_id":"arXiv:1605.00138","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"da38463446cd1cd29605a88339c3702535b0264d4f01281faa22af57da119069","kind":"theorem","label":"Theorem 118","ref_key":"thm:AMconj","name":"","order":150,"deps":[],"cite_keys":["A12-2"],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1605.00138","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"724ff59bda7dec23ea981e0821072acf559baccc91244b7151fe94c8b8c1233e","line":4836,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-27T22:13:42+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":346,"math_hints":31}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1605.00138","title":"Introduction to W-algebras and their representation theory","abstract":"These are lecture notes from author's mini-course during Session 1: \"Vertex algebras, W-algebras, and application\" of INdAM Intensive research period \"Perspectives in Lie Theory\", at the Centro di Ricerca Matematica Ennio De Giorgi, Pisa, Italy. December 9, 2014 -- February 28, 2015.","authors":["Tomoyuki Arakawa"],"year":"2016","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1605.00138","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"tss":"\\hspace{1pt}","ts":"\\,","Caff":"{C}^{\\kappa}","Fock":"\\mc{F}","ch":"\\on{ch}","Mi":"\\Upupsilon","affQ":"\\hat Q_{(0)}","affn":"\\widehat{\\mf{n}}","affh":"\\widehat{\\mf{h}}","finn":"\\mf{n}","finb":"\\mf{b}","finh":"\\mf{h}","KL":"\\mathbf{KL}","bra":"{\\langle}","ket":"{\\rangle}","Lam":"\\Lambda","cprim